From e7a7b3582e634b8647f20a41a0715e44743aef74 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 09:17:28 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] test(2d): pin the Contour picks under a rotated work
 offset

The general pick rule of `wcs_yaw::rotate_params` also turns a Contour
start and exit pick into the generator frame. Before it, a start pick at
(36, 0) under a 90-degree work offset entered at (0, 25).

Refs #3326

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 crates/app/tests/contour_start_point.rs | 29 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
